{
  "name": "Snitcher — Default Deny",
  "description": "Allowlist mode. Denies every outgoing destination for Rex, Rex Server, Claude Code, Codex and Orca unless a more specific rule allows it. Requires the baseline group and its allow rules to be enabled first. Disable this group to fall back to Ask.",
