      "process": "identifier.AG92C3PT77/com.superlogical.rex",
      "action": "deny",
      "direction": "outgoing",
      "disabled": false,
      "priority": "high",
      "notes": "白名单模式兜底拒绝。同优先级下，任何更具体的放行规则都会胜出；停用本组即回到询问。",
      "remote": "any"
